msgid ""
"This article explains how a `MarvelMind <https://marvelmind.com/>`__ system "
"can be a short-range substitute for a GPS allowing position control modes "
"like Auto and Guided. See the `user manual "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>`__ for"
" more details on the system."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 `MarvelMind <https://marvelmind.com/>`__ 系统作为 GPS 的近距离替代品，实现 Auto 和"
" Guided 等位置控制模式。详细信息请参阅 `用户手册 "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>`__。"

