msgid ""
"Here is a package with tested param files for the Autopilot and Marvelmind "
"hedge: <https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_ardupilot_settings.zip> "
"Upload the param file corresponding to your version of Autopilot software "
"with  Mission Planner or QGroundControl."
msgstr ""
"此处有针对飞控和 Marvelmind hedge "
"测试过的参数文件包：<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_ardupilot_settings.zip>，请使用"
" Mission Planner 或 QGroundControl 上传与您的飞控软件版本对应的参数文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:34 4581d65f2c384679bdd522c308e4586c
#: 9c570091fdd040b199626a2cdf6521ef b65c4f5a345f440eacd49cf985a8f1a7
#: c681b38173e84a65bd90ed8a0b82ea38 c717f0346dba4c13b4d941a9d590e1e8
