"Set latitude and longitude of the point (X=0, Y=0) on the Marvelmind map in "
"Georeferencing settings of the modem in the dashboard"
msgstr "在控制面板调制解调器的地理参考设置中，设置 Marvelmind 地图上点（X=0，Y=0）的纬度和经度"

#: ../../source/docs/common-marvelmind.rst:35 56cf1ce2029e48dc82060a2f030ad23b
msgid ""
"Refer to section 11.11 of the `user manual "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>` to "
"setup correct north direction on the map"
msgstr ""
"参阅 `用户手册 "
"<https://marvelmind.com/pics/marvelmind_navigation_system_manual.pdf>` 第 "
"11.11 节，在地图上设置正确的北方向"

